Z||000000||Fiero2||08-14-2001||04:12 PM||||My 88 Formula has the fiberglass GT sail panels that have the scoop in them. Someone has ripped off the passenger one and we can't seem to get a hold of anyone to get just the right hand side one. I am so upset. It's bad enough they took it, but a week away from one of our favorite car shows is horrible!<BR>Crying doesn't make it anybetter, so I am hoping that someone can quickly help me get a replacement.<BR>Even trying to reach Focoa has been a dead end. We just keep getting just their voice mail, and even after leaving messages they won't call us back.<BR>Does anyone have one or know of someone who has one (we really just need the right hand passengers side) that we can get shipped ASAP.<BR>COD would be great. The lebanon NH show is this Saturday, so if I can get one in my hands by no later than this Friday night, Steve can get it painted and mounted by the show the next morning.<P>Please someone, Help!!!!!!!!<P>Marian<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Marians_sig_1.jpg">  <BR>I LOVE my Fiero!!!||||reg||4
