Z||000002||rogergarrison||08-14-2001||11:22 PM||||I know its gonna sound stupid, but as hot as its been, could the tape have just gotten hot and let loose in parking lot or driving down the road. Iv had moldings held on with the tape fall off before sitting in my parking lot. That scoop would also make a pretty strong pull in the wind and youd never even hear it go. If you dont have something by the weekend, put a small sign on it there explaining what happened. I know wont be great but at least may help judges to ignore the flaw. It sucks anyway. I was at Carlisle a couple years ago when they had a Fino there to show in manufacturers row that had been hit pretty hard in a parking lot along the way.||||reg||1
